'''Influenced items''' are special types of base [[item]]s with an expanded pool of exclusive [[modifier]]s, and are the only type of items that can obtain [[elevated modifier]]s. They can be recognized by their graphical effects and icon on the sides of the name plate. Influenced items are primarily dropped by [[influence]]d monsters and bosses. Certain [[unique item]]s are influenced as well.

