==Elder item==
[[File:Elder item example.png|thumb|400px|An example of a rare Elder item]]
{{see also|List of elder modifiers}}
'''Elder items''' are found in Elder-influenced maps or dropped by [[the Elder]] (including [[Uber Elder]] and Uber-[[Uber Elder]] fights which some of the drops are dual Shaper-Elder influenced), with the exception of {{il|Replica Eternity Shroud}}. It can be crafted by using an {{il|Elder's Exalted Orb}}. They can be recognized by their tentacle background and [[File:Elder-item-symbol.png]] symbols next to the item's name.
Other methods of acquiring Elder items include Elder [[Scarab]]s, [[Delve]] rewards and [[Incubator]]s.

*Prefix: {{c|mod|The Elder's}}
*Suffix: {{c|mod|of the Elder}}

Elder-influenced maps maps can be sold or offered as a mission by [[Commander Kirac|Kirac]]. The map item would have an implicit {{c|mod|Area is influenced by The Elder}}. 

===Elder-influenced unique items===
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|where=items.influences HOLDS "elder"
}}

==Unique items==
Certain unique items interact with equipped influenced items:
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|where=items.stat_text like "%influence%"
OR items.stat_text like "%shaper item%"
OR items.stat_text like "%elder item%"
|large=1
|level=1
|stat=1
}}

==Divination cards==
The following [[divination card]]s can be exchanged for influenced items:
{{Drop enabled base item table
|where=items.class_id="DivinationCard"
   AND (items.description LIKE "%Influence%" 
   OR items.description LIKE "%Shaper%Item%"
   OR items.description LIKE "%Elder%Item%"
   OR items.description LIKE "%Warlord%Item%"
   OR items.description LIKE "%Redeemer%Item%"
   OR items.description LIKE "%Crusader%Item%"
   OR items.description LIKE "%Hunter%Item%"
   OR items.description LIKE "%Voidforge%"
   OR items.description LIKE "%The Eternity Shroud%")
   AND items.description NOT LIKE "%Victario's Influence%"
   AND items.description NOT LIKE "%Headhunter%"
|stack_size=1
|description=1
}}

